<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Abhinav</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4, #fbc2eb, #a18cd1);
      color: #222;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #fff4d6);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      border: 3px solid #ff6b6b;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ff5e7a;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #333;
    }

    strong {
      color: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .bottom {
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-top: 3px dashed #ff9f1c;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    <p>My name is <strong>Abhinav</strong>. I really like soccer and games, and I enjoy spending my free time playing and having fun. I do not like school and homework very much, but I still try my best when I need to.</p>
    <p>My hobbies are sports, especially soccer. I love to play soccer in my free time because it makes me happy and helps me stay active.</p>

    <div class="bottom">
      <p>Artificial intelligence will probably change the future in amazing ways. It can help people learn faster, solve problems, and make everyday life easier. In the future, AI may become a big part of school, work, health care, and even entertainment. It can be very useful, but people also need to use it carefully and responsibly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
